        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"1191101e-9360-4233-be53-326187b444ac\",\"review_text\":\"the newest update is just trash\"},{\"review_id\":\"3cfb2153-69c7-42d2-9907-eecc8b225e82\",\"review_text\":\"Pls solve the issue of volume suddenly tearing up when kept in equaliser mode and switching to the sound of other apps eg: when my song is playing in Spotify with equaliser on and then I clicked on WhatsApp to check a video status once the video is finished and the sound transfers to the background music on Spotify it suddenly tears up my ear giving a sudden massive loud sound on my ears for 2 sec which is too uncomfortable same happens when I pick up any call and come back to Spotify pls solve\"},{\"review_id\":\"ff629160-3567-4915-9b94-a2eb05a6983e\",\"review_text\":\"Attempts to collect information way too times in a given session via at least three trackers. If Apple Music was on par with playlist features and had some albums and songs I'm missing, I wouldn't use this at all.\"},{\"review_id\":\"cd9a7079-9c8a-464a-838f-cf7c7cd6b96d\",\"review_text\":\"Hate is app\"},{\"review_id\":\"8b2b4662-8e2c-4ce4-a90a-667e2b63b372\",\"review_text\":\"I didn't wanted to 1 star also like come on you just removed the basic Features of the music app in the new update and if you think people are this stupid that they will give money to you for this they would better download a mod version\"},{\"review_id\":\"c97171ad-3ef2-41bb-b811-f95a395311b7\",\"review_text\":\"Enjoying ~\"},{\"review_id\":\"d62b7c39-fe8a-4ff6-aba2-0ac0dd4c7644\",\"review_text\":\"Worst app too many adds .... Wasting of time\"},{\"review_id\":\"04cb1057-1719-4315-8623-28baf505f97f\",\"review_text\":\"It's kinda slow sometimes but then again it might be my phone but so far it has been nothing but amazing\"},{\"review_id\":\"76646f02-4bf3-4667-ac47-9211317ceac2\",\"review_text\":\"Straight 🍑\"},{\"review_id\":\"d1c54d68-13ad-4112-ae14-15f2ad8bdd5c\",\"review_text\":\"Everything is great except one thing, we need the section that shows what do the people we follow listen to, the one we have on computer version but we don't have it on mobile app, please please please please please add that section to our mobile apps too, we need to know what other people are listening to while we are using our phones\"},{\"review_id\":\"247da783-cfa1-4cf1-b80a-84dc5af10fd8\",\"review_text\":\"ARE YOU SERIOUS WITH THE NEW UPDAT!? IF I COULD GIVE YOU A ZERO I WOULD. I CANT EVEN CHOOSE WHAT I WANT TO LISTEN LET ALONE REWINDE.\"},{\"review_id\":\"7d1211a9-d6e4-4763-a526-84c8d91ddae5\",\"review_text\":\"I LUV MY MUZIK 💯😎🥰🌞\"},{\"review_id\":\"6d190bef-d73c-4da9-920e-f20ca107735d\",\"review_text\":\"The best without any competitor\"},{\"review_id\":\"7c32422b-d6ea-4c36-ab0a-a78689868fb7\",\"review_text\":\"I have over 2000 songs on my Liked songs playlist.. shuffling doesnt exist. No matter how many times i reshuffle my playlist, it still plays the same handful of songs. Absolutely ridiculous\"},{\"review_id\":\"bbc175d7-726e-4570-a411-0ca89c29a127\",\"review_text\":\"Harm full block this app\"},{\"review_id\":\"156d86e2-7f60-445f-9d07-0a6047b97182\",\"review_text\":\"the app ao stupid\"},{\"review_id\":\"f3c76359-9a3b-4a3a-b5b6-b24ef0537ac8\",\"review_text\":\"Not good very all premium yy yy yu\"},{\"review_id\":\"ad6b4878-58ae-4d12-ba17-fec4fbe11e5a\",\"review_text\":\"Exceptional great\"},{\"review_id\":\"41e15ed0-2ee4-4f3a-9a60-c4eb45de3fbe\",\"review_text\":\"this app is good for playing music 🎶\"},{\"review_id\":\"b5208278-9055-4f7e-a70c-64f850a451ee\",\"review_text\":\"Spotify is really helpful to listen songs\"}]}"
